# Monorepo conventions

## Layout

- `tooling/*` — shared presets only (`@monorepo/tsconfig`, `@monorepo/eslint-config`, `@monorepo/prettier-config`). Export base / node / react (and similar) for children to extend. Root must not import apps or packages.
- `apps/*` — runnable apps. Each app: `eslint.config.js` re-exports a tooling preset (e.g. `@monorepo/eslint-config/react`), `"lint": "eslint ."`, tsconfig extends `@monorepo/tsconfig/*`.
- `packages/*` — installable workspace libraries (`workspace:*`).
- `shared/*` — shared source imported directly.

No root `eslint.config.js`. No custom lint-staged discovery scripts. Pre-commit: `lint-staged` (Prettier) + `pnpm -r run lint`.

## Quality bar

Developer-friendly structure, stable library versions, industry-standard patterns. Prefer extending `tooling/` presets over duplicating config. Root orchestrates; children extend standards.

See `SETUP.md`.
